  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The postcard features a black and white photograph of a mountainous and rugged landscape. Prominently in the foreground is a stone border marker inscribed with 'NORGE 1930 No 266B.' Behind the marker are ruins of a stone building and a few scattered houses. The background shows misty mountains and a lake. There is Swedish text at the bottom describing the scene."
